# Colorless is not a color: a red Mox pays Sol Ring, whose {C}{C} plus a white Mox and Black Lotus's three blue pay
# the six. Of those mana only white and blue are colors, so X is two (the Moxen's red went into Sol Ring, which is
# not mana spent to cast Together as One).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Sol Ring
Black Lotus
Together as One
Island
Island
Island x6

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
? Bot1.Mana = {W}{U}{U}{U}{C}{C}
Bot1.Hand.Together as One.Cast
Bot1.Target(Bot1)
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
[Bot1.Main2]

